      "review_summary": "The PR forwards Discord reply policy metadata through some outbound send options and changes media caption follow-up chunks to omit `replyTo`.\n\nPR surface: Source +14. Total +14 across 4 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. The underlying issue is source-reproducible because current main and the PR head build chunked Discord text sends with the same `replyTo`; the linked issue also provides instrumented Discord request logs.",
